		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
			wrestling-place</i> in the Palaestra. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b> (late Lat.), <i><span class="en">Cael.
