					<i><span class="en">Hier. Joann. Hieros. 16</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">id. Ep. 61, 5</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Ambros. Off. 1, 16</span></i>.
			—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>a wrestling</i>, <i>a contest</i>, <i><span class="en">Tert. adv.
